Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:05:05 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Open the launcher on launch and report a finished update
 (#1688)

Opening Tinycast from Finder, Spotlight or the updater's relaunch now
shows the launcher, the way a Dock click on a running copy does. A
login-item or URL launch stays silent, and the first launch still
shows onboarding.

A successful install records its version in update-check.json. The
first launch running that version shows "Updated to Tinycast X" once;
a launch of any other version only clears the record.
